{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1480647-scps-as-chronicles-of-darkness-creatures","id":1480647,"title":"Scps as chronicles of darkness creatures","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-10T03:03:38-07:00","id":1480647,"title":"Scps as chronicles of darkness creatures","content":"So i was thinking it would be a fun idea to see what people think some scps would be in chronicles of darkness, choose yourself what scp you want to talk about<br /> <br /> <br /> The only thing i would like is that people only choose generic horror if there was no other place to put it because if not this would be very boring<br /> <br /> Let's see what happens","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27340-anyoneatall","name":"Anyoneatall","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-10T15:08:03-07:00","id":1480696,"title":"","content":"I'm working on a lot of things because I have a SCP chronicles. Until now this are my approximations, not specific SPCs [most on my play are Horrors or Mortal with a gimmick for the most part], but general utilities:<ul><li><b>Sarkic Cultist/Sarkic Creatures:</b> Most sarkic cultist are simply mortals with Biokinesis and some advance merit of it, but full shapeshifter High Sarkist are Werewolf with flesh skin and Vampire Blood Sorcery, most aligned with Cruac one [Using the system from the Rites of Damnation fan supplement]. Using Vitae but the kiss is more cannibalistic in nature.</li> <li><b>Clockwork Orthodoxy:</b> Totally the Broken from Deviant but with Humanity instead of the Touchstone system. I forgot how the mechanical ones are named, but that.</li> <li><b>Reality Benders:</b> For the most part, mages but without the limitations of sleepers. Demons embed and exploits can be use as minor reality bender powers, but can distort the fabric of reality as a real reality bender does.</li> <li><b>Thaumaturgy:</b> I have two thaumaturgic system on my games, one create and being tested by myself and a friend with a more freeform little-merit based magic, using the rules on Third Eye fan supplement and the mortal magic with ephemeral entities, and the other being a Merit based one inspired by the Official Blood Sorcery.</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27384-altidiya","name":"altidiya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27384_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}